   announced in good time.
3. Unless expressly permitted by law, you may not modify, translate, decompile or reverse engineer the program,
   redistribute, sell, rent or offer it for download elsewhere (linking to the official download page is welcome),
   or remove licence or copyright notices.
4. Liability. As RigVibe is provided free of charge, liability is limited to intent and gross negligence and to
   fraudulently concealed defects; liability under product liability law is not affected. The operator is
   responsible for complying with amateur radio regulations.
5. Third-party components bundled with RigVibe (e.g. Hamlib, rtl_tcp, rtl_433) are subject to their own licences,
   listed in LIZENZEN.md. These terms do not restrict any rights under those licences.
6. German law applies.
